  <!-- EN: convergence death ray turret -->
  <DNX_Turret_ConvergenceDeathRay.label>汇聚死亡射线炮塔</DNX_Turret_ConvergenceDeathRay.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental high-energy weapon that converges three red focusing beams before firing a catastrophic white death ray at the target area. -->
  <DNX_Turret_ConvergenceDeathRay.description>一种实验性高能武器，会先汇聚三道红色聚焦光束，再向目标区域发射毁灭性的白色死亡射线。</DNX_Turret_ConvergenceDeathRay.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Little Train RG prototype -->
  <DNX_Turret_LittleTrainRGPrototype.label>小火车RG原型</DNX_Turret_LittleTrainRGPrototype.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental railgun turret that fires a high-energy penetrator, cutting through hostile targets in a long line and discharging EMP at the impact point. -->
  <DNX_Turret_LittleTrainRGPrototype.description>一座实验性轨道炮炮塔，会发射高能穿透弹，沿长直线贯穿敌对目标，并在命中点释放电磁脉冲。</DNX_Turret_LittleTrainRGPrototype.description>
